    "delineation": "Chapter",
    "number": 34,
    "summary": "The Second Coming will be a day of vengeance and judgment—The indignation of the Lord will be upon all nations—His sword will fall upon the world.",
    "chapterAugmentations": [],
    "verses": [
      {
        "text": "Come near, ye nations, to hear; and hearken, ye people: let the earth hear, and all that is therein; the world, and all things that come forth of it.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
