        "reference": "Isaiah 34:7",
        "book": "Isaiah",
        "chapter": 34,
        "verse": 7
      },
      {
        "text": "For it is the day of the Lord’s vengeance, and the year of recompences for the controversy of Zion.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 32,
            "end": 41,
            "text": "Isa. 61:2; Mal. 4:1 (1, 3); 3 Ne. 21:21 (20–21); D&C 97:26 (25–28)."
